#@METADATA os=nixos-26
#===============================================================================
# nixos.init
# Init sequence for a RAM-booted NixOS node. base/ inits run first (common-post
# is os=*; its functions are safe or skip with a log line on NixOS). ctrl-exec
# and opensvc inits are not selected for nixos: hps-node-init pairs the agent.
#
# Not added: syslog forwarding. Alpine's n_configure_syslog edits OpenRC files;
# on NixOS the logger set-up belongs in the image (nix/modules). Until then
# n_remote_log falls back to the IPS log_message call (no syslogd running), so
# bundle-side messages reach the IPS from the first init action.
#===============================================================================

# Transient hostname from the registry; /etc/hostname and /etc/hosts untouched.
n_set_hostname_and_hosts
